The '''Old Market''' was a location in [[Capital City]] on the [[planet]] [[Lothal]].<ref name="Empire Day" /> There were frequently many [[Alien|nonhuman]] individuals at the market.<ref name="Danger">''[[Ezra's Duel with Danger]]''</ref> After the resistance fighters known as the [[Spectres]] [[Bombing at the Empire Day parade|attacked]] the [[Empire Day]] [[parade]] through the [[city]]<ref name="Empire Day" /> in [[4 BBY]],<ref name="Galactic Atlas">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> the [[Lasat]] [[Garazeb Orrelios]] contacted the [[Twi'lek]] [[Hera Syndulla]] to suggest a backup rendezvous point. Addressing Syndulla by<ref name="Empire Day" /> her<ref name="Galactic Atlas" /> code name Spectre-2, Orrelios asked if she could reach the Old Market. When Syndulla confirmed, Orrelios set off to meet her at the market, climbing the side of a building to evade [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Lothal garrison|forces]]. The pair subsequently rendezvoused and assisted the rest of their companions in escaping.<ref name="Empire Day" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Old Market was mentioned in "[[Empire Day (episode)|Empire Day]],"<ref name="Empire Day" /> the eighth episode of the [[Star Wars Rebels Season One|first season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]'',<ref name="Episode Guide">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels-empire-day-episode-guide|text="Empire Day" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars Rebels}}</ref> which aired on [[November 17]], [[2014]].<ref name="Insider 156">{{InsiderCite|156|Star Wars Rebels Recounted|''Star Wars Rebels'' Recounted}}</ref>

